Revision history for WebService-Moodle-Simple

0.07  2026-11-21 17:02:47 UTC
        - Moodle 5.3 support (still works with Moodle 3.2)
        - send all requests as POST form data; check_password needs this on Moodle 5.3
        - set_password reports failure when Moodle returns an exception or warnings
        - suspend_user returns { ok => <bool> } instead of undef

